	(text "VBUS sense is active LOW at PC4 and remains isolated when the MCU is unpowered.\nFirmware: disable PA9 hardware VBUS sensing (PA9 is USART1_TX); attach USB only when USB_PRESENT_N is LOW.\nRoute D+/D- as a short matched 90-ohm differential pair. Place ESD at connector, series resistors at MCU.\nJoin duplicate A/B USB2 contacts near connector. SBU pins NC; shield bonded to ground with short stitching vias.\nRaw VBUS capacitance is 1.1uF; downstream capacitance sits behind the controlled switch. No USB-PD voltage request."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 238 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b7ab4be7-0565-559c-8f2e-35e0e217f50f")
	)
